# Cubase harness project: only the .cpr and the small build parts in Misc/ are in git (2026-10-29).
# Everything below is rebuilt or per machine.

# harness-input.wav: rebuild with  python ../tertiary_harness_build.py audio
Audio/
# the import copy of the input (same file as Audio/harness-input.wav)
Misc/*.wav
# Cubase's waveform caches, exports, backups
Images/
*.peak
Mixdown/
Auto Saves/
*.bak
*.csh
Track Pictures/
# run logs, screenshots and renders from tertiary_harness_run.ps1
Runs/
# goldens are per machine and live outside the repo: %USERPROFILE%\.wla-test\goldens\tertiary\cubase\
Golden/
